\\\", instead of being rejected. Also the countdown text disappeared entirely.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-12\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"View Details action non-functional\", \"actual\": \"Clicked \\\"View Details\\\" on multiple venue cards (Rosewood Garden Estate, Sunset Beach Resort). No modal, dialog, or navigation occurred; the page URL and DOM state remained unchanged, and no dialog element was added. Users cannot open a listing to view any additional/complete details beyond what's already on the card.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Marking tasks cl1-1 and cl1-2 complete updated checklist progress instantly from 0%→33%; dashboard aggregate progress updated to 33% with preview \\\"2 of 6 completed\\\". Unmarking cl1-2 updated to 17% immediately. Reloading the checklists page preserved 17% and the \\\"Saved\\\" state.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Filter toggles updated visible results and count immediately without any submit button (e.g. clicking Garden toggle instantly changed \\\"Showing 8 of 8\\\" to \\\"Showing 2 of 8\\\"). Clear all filters instantly restored the full list.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-19\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Cancelled draft persists in editor state\", \"actual\": \"After changing Partner One to \\\"Changed\\\" and budget to \\\"99999\\\" then clicking Cancel, the dashboard display correctly retained \\\"Alex & Jordan\\\" and \\\"$30,000\\\". However, reopening the editor afterward showed the cancelled draft values (\\\"Changed\\\" / \\\"99999\\\") instead of the last saved values (\\\"Alex\\\" / \\\"30000\\\"), violating the requirement that reopening should show last saved values rather than the cancelled draft.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Dashboard shows couple names (Alex & Jordan), formatted date (Jun 15, 2027), budget ($30,000), guest count (150), progress (0%), favorite counts (0 saved venues/vendors), saved-checklist count (0 saved).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Venue cards show name, location, venue type, price range, rating, description, and guest capacity (e.g. Rosewood Garden Estate: Napa Valley CA, Garden, Luxury $$$, 4.9, description, \\\"Up to 200 guests\\\"). Vendor cards show name, location, service type, price range, rating, description, and specialty tags (e.g. Eternal Moments Photography: Los Angeles CA, Photography, Luxury $$$, 4.9, description, \\\"Candid Shots/Drone Photography/Same-Day Edits\\\").\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Category filters present: Planning, Ceremony, Reception, Attire, Honeymoon. Checklists exist per category (cl1/cl2=Planning, cl3=Ceremony, cl4=Reception, cl5=Attire, cl6=Honeymoon). Each task in expanded checklist cl1 has both a title and an explanatory description.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-18\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Combining Photography+Budget filters (no vendor matches both) produced \\\"Showing 0 of 10 vendors\\\" with clear empty-state message \\\"No vendors match your search.\\\" Clear all filters restored 10/10. Combined criteria (Garden+Luxury, Florist+Budget) each correctly returned only matching items with accurate counts.\"}]}"
